{"id":"a4af62d1c1b0b08f","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-general-consistency.md","title":"Arithmetic Consistency of a Finite Language Theory","display":"df-general-consistency — Arithmetic Consistency of a Finite Language Theory","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-general-consistency","aliases":["67-df-general-consistency"],"display":"df-general-consistency — Arithmetic Consistency of a Finite Language Theory","depends_on":["[[67-df-pr-definitional-extension]]","[[67-df-formula-provability]]","[[67-df-formula]]","[[67-df-predicate-logic]]","[[67-df-sequence]]","[[67-df-godel-encoding]]","[[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]","[[67-df-primitive-recursive]]","[[67-df-strong-godel-encoding]]","[[67-df-pr-graph-interface]]"],"source_edition":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition","source_scope":"第 8 章导言与 §1，印刷页 119–120；PDF 第 130–131 页；第 1 章，印刷页 13–14；PDF 第 24–25 页","verification_status":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified","source_proof_status":"本轮检查形式陈述、类型和依赖；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"inherited_verification_status":"local-interface-checked","inherited_source_proof_status":"一般语言证明检查和一致性句为显式重建；标准证明码与原书内部算术化的全式转换未完成","machine_verified":false,"revision_date":"2026-10-14"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-general-consistency"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-general-consistency</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-general-consistency — Arithmetic Consistency of a Finite Language Theory"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2fbf7ac563ea4261\" href=\"?note=2fbf7ac563ea4261\" title=\"67-df-pr-definitional-extension\">67-df-pr-definitional-extension</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1e05755479add015\" href=\"?note=1e05755479add015\" title=\"67-df-formula-provability\">67-df-formula-provability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2035a1f4d72e7df9\" href=\"?note=2035a1f4d72e7df9\" title=\"67-df-formula\">67-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9a1432082607876a\" href=\"?note=9a1432082607876a\" title=\"67-df-predicate-logic\">67-df-predicate-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"338538aaf52f60c4\" href=\"?note=338538aaf52f60c4\" title=\"67-df-sequence\">67-df-sequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e5654af7c954e1c0\" href=\"?note=e5654af7c954e1c0\" title=\"67-df-godel-encoding\">67-df-godel-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"55353aba49d6b3f2\" href=\"?note=55353aba49d6b3f2\" title=\"67-df-primitive-recursive\">67-df-primitive-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"a329235da6144513\" href=\"?note=a329235da6144513\" title=\"67-df-strong-godel-encoding\">67-df-strong-godel-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"f115352299e944bf\" href=\"?note=f115352299e944bf\" title=\"67-df-pr-graph-interface\">67-df-pr-graph-interface</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"第 8 章导言与 §1，印刷页 119–120；PDF 第 130–131 页；第 1 章，印刷页 13–14；PDF 第 24–25 页"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本轮检查形式陈述、类型和依赖；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"local-interface-checked"},{"key":"inherited_source_proof_status","html":"一般语言证明检查和一致性句为显式重建；标准证明码与原书内部算术化的全式转换未完成"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 为有限有效一阶语言，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_L=c_L\">\\(g_L=c_L\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"a329235da6144513\" href=\"?note=a329235da6144513\" title=\"67-df-strong-godel-encoding\">67-df-strong-godel-encoding</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LogAx}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{LogAx}_L\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LocalLine}_{\\varnothing,L}\">\\(\\operatorname{LocalLine}_{\\varnothing,L}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"9a1432082607876a\" href=\"?note=9a1432082607876a\" title=\"67-df-predicate-logic\">67-df-predicate-logic</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_L=\\neg\\forall v_0(v_0=v_0)\">\\(\\bot_L=\\neg\\forall v_0(v_0=v_0)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"2035a1f4d72e7df9\" href=\"?note=2035a1f4d72e7df9\" title=\"67-df-formula\">67-df-formula</a>，不使用语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 中未声明的常元。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc},\\operatorname{Len},(p)_i\">\\(\\operatorname{enc},\\operatorname{Len},(p)_i\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"338538aaf52f60c4\" href=\"?note=338538aaf52f60c4\" title=\"67-df-sequence\">67-df-sequence</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PRProg}_k,\\mathrm{PRPred}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{PRProg}_k,\\mathrm{PRPred}_1\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"55353aba49d6b3f2\" href=\"?note=55353aba49d6b3f2\" title=\"67-df-primitive-recursive\">67-df-primitive-recursive</a>；固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"f115352299e944bf\" href=\"?note=f115352299e944bf\" title=\"67-df-pr-graph-interface\">67-df-pr-graph-interface</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)\">\\(\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>固定下式每个数值函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\{\\mathrm{fm}_L,\\mathrm{sn}_L,\\mathrm{la}_L,\\mathrm{imp}_L,\\mathrm{all}_L\\}\">\\(f\\in\\{\\mathrm{fm}_L,\\mathrm{sn}_L,\\mathrm{la}_L,\\mathrm{imp}_L,\\mathrm{all}_L\\}\\)</span> 的程序 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_f\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_{\\operatorname{arity}(f)}\">\\(e_f\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_{\\operatorname{arity}(f)}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"⟦ e_f⟧=f\">\\(⟦ e_f⟧=f\\)</span>。对象公式中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_{e_f}\">\\(F_{e_f}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Len}\">\\(\\operatorname{Len}\\)</span>、序列投影使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"1e05755479add015\" href=\"?note=1e05755479add015\" title=\"67-df-formula-provability\">67-df-formula-provability</a> 的同一指定程序，并由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-18\" data-note=\"2fbf7ac563ea4261\" href=\"?note=2fbf7ac563ea4261\" title=\"67-df-pr-definitional-extension\">67-df-pr-definitional-extension</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_D\">\\(E_D\\)</span> 消去。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A_L\">\\(\\mathcal A_L\\)</span> 是下式的 PR 公理集类；固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_L\">\\(\\pi_L\\)</span> 满足下式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GPrfSystem}_L(\\pi_L)\">\\(\\mathrm{GPrfSystem}_L(\\pi_L)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_{L,A},e_{L,A}\">\\(a_{L,A},e_{L,A}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_L(A)\">\\(\\pi_L(A)\\)</span> 的两项投影，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal A_L\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal A_L\\)</span>。整个理论及其所有有限片段均使用同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_L\">\\(\\pi_L\\)</span>，不逐次任意更换证明表示。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[z]\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[z]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u,v,z\">\\(u,v,z\\)</span> 为互异算术变量；所有辅助绑定变量按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-19\" data-note=\"2035a1f4d72e7df9\" href=\"?note=2035a1f4d72e7df9\" title=\"67-df-formula\">67-df-formula</a> 的新鲜变量规则选择。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}^L_\\sigma,\\mathrm{Pr}^L_\\sigma,\\mathrm{Con}^L_\\sigma\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}^L_\\sigma,\\mathrm{Pr}^L_\\sigma,\\mathrm{Con}^L_\\sigma\\)</span> 的下标为公理表示公式，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}^L_A,\\mathrm{Pr}^L_A,\\mathrm{Con}^L_A\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}^L_A,\\mathrm{Pr}^L_A,\\mathrm{Con}^L_A\\)</span> 的下标为公理集，二者由类型区分。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(F\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span> 为有限集合；其有序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec\\varphi_F\">\\(\\vec\\varphi_F\\)</span> 和公理公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma^L_F\">\\(\\sigma^L_F\\)</span> 在下式构造。空析取取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_{L_A}\">\\(\\bot_{L_A}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；数值函数及外部证明关系中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,n,m,i,j,h\">\\(p,n,m,i,j,h\\)</span> 遍历自然数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_D(\\cdot)\">\\(E_D(\\cdot)\\)</span> 内同名占位符则是相应的对象变量并由所列对象量词绑定。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[u,v]\">\\(P\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[u,v]\\)</span> 为候选证明公式。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StdGPrf}_{L,A}\">\\(\\mathrm{StdGPrf}_{L,A}\\)</span> 包含 PA 内逐式桥接条件，不仅是标准模型中的外延正确性；这是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GPrfSystem}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{GPrfSystem}_L\\)</span> 的显式组成部分。所有一致性公式均在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_A\">\\(L_A\\)</span> 中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n\">\\(\\bar n\\)</span> 均是算术数词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal A_L&amp;\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L:g_L[A]\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_1\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{fm}_L(n)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1,&amp;n\\in g_L[\\mathrm{Fml}_L],\\\\0,&amp;n\\notin g_L[\\mathrm{Fml}_L],\\end{cases}&amp;\n\\mathrm{sn}_L(n)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1,&amp;n\\in g_L[\\mathrm{Sent}_L],\\\\0,&amp;n\\notin g_L[\\mathrm{Sent}_L],\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathrm{la}_L(n)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1,&amp;n\\in g_L[\\mathrm{LogAx}_L],\\\\0,&amp;n\\notin g_L[\\mathrm{LogAx}_L],\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathrm{imp}_L(n,m)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}\\!\\left(\\left\\langle4,\n\\operatorname{enc}\\!\\left(\\left\\langle5,n,\\operatorname{enc}(\\langle4,m\\rangle)\\right\\rangle\\right)\\right\\rangle\\right),\\\\\n\\mathrm{all}_L(i,n)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}(\\langle6,i,n\\rangle),\\\\\n\\lambda_L(p,i)&amp;\\coloneqq E_D\\!\\Bigl(i&lt;\\operatorname{Len}(p)\n\\land\\forall j&lt;\\operatorname{Len}(p)\\ (\\mathrm{fm}_L((p)_j)=1)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\bigl[\\mathrm{la}_L((p)_i)=1\n\\lor\\exists j&lt;i\\exists h&lt;i\\ ((p)_h=\\mathrm{imp}_L((p)_j,(p)_i))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{7em}\\lor\\exists j&lt;i\\ ((p)_i=\\mathrm{all}_L(((p)_i)_1,(p)_j))\\bigr]\\Bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Prf}^{L}_{\\sigma}(u,v)&amp;\\coloneqq E_D\\!\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Len}(u)&gt;0\\land\\mathrm{fm}_L(v)=1\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\exists j&lt;\\operatorname{Len}(u)\\ (j+1=\\operatorname{Len}(u)\\land(u)_j=v)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall i&lt;\\operatorname{Len}(u)\\\n\\bigl[\\lambda_L(u,i)\\lor(\\mathrm{sn}_L((u)_i)=1\\land\\sigma[(u)_i/z])\\bigr]\\Bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Pr}^{L}_{\\sigma}(v)&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists u\\,\\mathrm{Prf}^{L}_{\\sigma}(u,v),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Con}^{L}_{\\sigma}&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg\\mathrm{Pr}^{L}_{\\sigma}(\\overline{g_L(\\bot_L)}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal A_L&amp;\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L:g_L[A]\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_1\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{fm}_L(n)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1,&amp;n\\in g_L[\\mathrm{Fml}_L],\\\\0,&amp;n\\notin g_L[\\mathrm{Fml}_L],\\end{cases}&amp;\n\\mathrm{sn}_L(n)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1,&amp;n\\in g_L[\\mathrm{Sent}_L],\\\\0,&amp;n\\notin g_L[\\mathrm{Sent}_L],\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathrm{la}_L(n)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1,&amp;n\\in g_L[\\mathrm{LogAx}_L],\\\\0,&amp;n\\notin g_L[\\mathrm{LogAx}_L],\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathrm{imp}_L(n,m)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}\\!\\left(\\left\\langle4,\n\\operatorname{enc}\\!\\left(\\left\\langle5,n,\\operatorname{enc}(\\langle4,m\\rangle)\\right\\rangle\\right)\\right\\rangle\\right),\\\\\n\\mathrm{all}_L(i,n)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}(\\langle6,i,n\\rangle),\\\\\n\\lambda_L(p,i)&amp;\\coloneqq E_D\\!\\Bigl(i&lt;\\operatorname{Len}(p)\n\\land\\forall j&lt;\\operatorname{Len}(p)\\ (\\mathrm{fm}_L((p)_j)=1)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\bigl[\\mathrm{la}_L((p)_i)=1\n\\lor\\exists j&lt;i\\exists h&lt;i\\ ((p)_h=\\mathrm{imp}_L((p)_j,(p)_i))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{7em}\\lor\\exists j&lt;i\\ ((p)_i=\\mathrm{all}_L(((p)_i)_1,(p)_j))\\bigr]\\Bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Prf}^{L}_{\\sigma}(u,v)&amp;\\coloneqq E_D\\!\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Len}(u)&gt;0\\land\\mathrm{fm}_L(v)=1\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\exists j&lt;\\operatorname{Len}(u)\\ (j+1=\\operatorname{Len}(u)\\land(u)_j=v)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall i&lt;\\operatorname{Len}(u)\\\n\\bigl[\\lambda_L(u,i)\\lor(\\mathrm{sn}_L((u)_i)=1\\land\\sigma[(u)_i/z])\\bigr]\\Bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Pr}^{L}_{\\sigma}(v)&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists u\\,\\mathrm{Prf}^{L}_{\\sigma}(u,v),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Con}^{L}_{\\sigma}&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg\\mathrm{Pr}^{L}_{\\sigma}(\\overline{g_L(\\bot_L)}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\vec\\varphi_F&amp;\\coloneqq\\iota\\vec\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L^{|F|}\\\n\\left[\\{\\varphi_i:i&lt;|F|\\}=F\\land\\forall i&lt;j&lt;|F|\\ (g_L(\\varphi_i)&lt;g_L(\\varphi_j))\\right],\\\\\na_{L,A}&amp;\\coloneqq(\\pi_L(A))_0,&amp;e_{L,A}&amp;\\coloneqq(\\pi_L(A))_1,\\\\\n\\sigma^L_A(z)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\n\\displaystyle\\bigvee\\langle z=\\overline{g_L((\\vec\\varphi_A)_i)}\\rangle_{i&lt;|A|},&amp;|A|&lt;\\aleph_0,\\\\\nD_{a_{L,A}}(z,1),&amp;|A|\\ge\\aleph_0,\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathrm{PrfRel}_{L,A}(p,n)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Seq}(p)\\land\\operatorname{Len}(p)&gt;0\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\exists\\vec\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L^{\\operatorname{Len}(p)}\\ \\bigl[\n\\forall j&lt;\\operatorname{Len}(p)\\ ((p)_j=g_L(\\varphi_j))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall i&lt;\\operatorname{Len}(p)\\\n(\\operatorname{LocalLine}_{\\varnothing,L}(\\vec\\varphi,i)\\lor\\varphi_i\\in A)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\exists j&lt;\\operatorname{Len}(p)\\ (j+1=\\operatorname{Len}(p)\\land(p)_j=n)\\bigr],\\\\\nh_{L,A}(p,n)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}0,&amp;\\mathrm{PrfRel}_{L,A}(p,n),\\\\1,&amp;\\neg\\mathrm{PrfRel}_{L,A}(p,n),\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathrm{StdGPrf}_{L,A}(P,e)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\ne\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_2\\land P\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[u,v]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall p,n\\in\\mathbb N\\ (⟦ e⟧(p,n)=h_{L,A}(p,n))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land P=D_e(u,v,0)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\left(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\forall u\\forall v\\\n(P(u,v)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Prf}^{L}_{\\sigma^L_A}(u,v))\\right),\\\\\n\\mathrm{GPrfSystem}_L(\\pi_L)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\pi_L:\\mathcal A_L\\to\\mathrm{PRProg}_1\\times\\mathrm{PRProg}_2\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A_L\\ \\bigl[\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ (⟦ a_{L,A}⟧(n)\\in\\{0,1\\}\n\\land(⟦ a_{L,A}⟧(n)=1\\leftrightarrow n\\in g_L[A]))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{StdGPrf}_{L,A}(D_{e_{L,A}}(u,v,0),e_{L,A})\\bigr],\\\\\n\\delta_{h_{L,A}}&amp;\\coloneqq D_{e_{L,A}},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Prf}^{L}_{A}(u,v)&amp;\\coloneqq D_{e_{L,A}}(u,v,0),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Pr}^{L}_{A}(v)&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists u\\,\\mathrm{Prf}^{L}_{A}(u,v),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Con}^{L}_{A}&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg\\mathrm{Pr}^{L}_{A}(\\overline{g_L(\\bot_L)}),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\left(\\mathrm{Con}^{L}_{A}\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Con}^{L}_{\\sigma^L_A}\\right),\\\\\nA\\upharpoonright_{g_L}k&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in A:g_L(\\varphi)\\le k\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}_L(A)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\mathrm{PrfRel}_{L,A}(p,g_L(\\bot_L)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\vec\\varphi_F&amp;\\coloneqq\\iota\\vec\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L^{|F|}\\\n\\left[\\{\\varphi_i:i&lt;|F|\\}=F\\land\\forall i&lt;j&lt;|F|\\ (g_L(\\varphi_i)&lt;g_L(\\varphi_j))\\right],\\\\\na_{L,A}&amp;\\coloneqq(\\pi_L(A))_0,&amp;e_{L,A}&amp;\\coloneqq(\\pi_L(A))_1,\\\\\n\\sigma^L_A(z)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\n\\displaystyle\\bigvee\\langle z=\\overline{g_L((\\vec\\varphi_A)_i)}\\rangle_{i&lt;|A|},&amp;|A|&lt;\\aleph_0,\\\\\nD_{a_{L,A}}(z,1),&amp;|A|\\ge\\aleph_0,\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathrm{PrfRel}_{L,A}(p,n)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Seq}(p)\\land\\operatorname{Len}(p)&gt;0\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\exists\\vec\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L^{\\operatorname{Len}(p)}\\ \\bigl[\n\\forall j&lt;\\operatorname{Len}(p)\\ ((p)_j=g_L(\\varphi_j))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall i&lt;\\operatorname{Len}(p)\\\n(\\operatorname{LocalLine}_{\\varnothing,L}(\\vec\\varphi,i)\\lor\\varphi_i\\in A)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\exists j&lt;\\operatorname{Len}(p)\\ (j+1=\\operatorname{Len}(p)\\land(p)_j=n)\\bigr],\\\\\nh_{L,A}(p,n)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}0,&amp;\\mathrm{PrfRel}_{L,A}(p,n),\\\\1,&amp;\\neg\\mathrm{PrfRel}_{L,A}(p,n),\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathrm{StdGPrf}_{L,A}(P,e)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\ne\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_2\\land P\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[u,v]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall p,n\\in\\mathbb N\\ (⟦ e⟧(p,n)=h_{L,A}(p,n))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land P=D_e(u,v,0)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\left(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\forall u\\forall v\\\n(P(u,v)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Prf}^{L}_{\\sigma^L_A}(u,v))\\right),\\\\\n\\mathrm{GPrfSystem}_L(\\pi_L)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\pi_L:\\mathcal A_L\\to\\mathrm{PRProg}_1\\times\\mathrm{PRProg}_2\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A_L\\ \\bigl[\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ (⟦ a_{L,A}⟧(n)\\in\\{0,1\\}\n\\land(⟦ a_{L,A}⟧(n)=1\\leftrightarrow n\\in g_L[A]))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{StdGPrf}_{L,A}(D_{e_{L,A}}(u,v,0),e_{L,A})\\bigr],\\\\\n\\delta_{h_{L,A}}&amp;\\coloneqq D_{e_{L,A}},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Prf}^{L}_{A}(u,v)&amp;\\coloneqq D_{e_{L,A}}(u,v,0),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Pr}^{L}_{A}(v)&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists u\\,\\mathrm{Prf}^{L}_{A}(u,v),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Con}^{L}_{A}&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg\\mathrm{Pr}^{L}_{A}(\\overline{g_L(\\bot_L)}),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\left(\\mathrm{Con}^{L}_{A}\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Con}^{L}_{\\sigma^L_A}\\right),\\\\\nA\\upharpoonright_{g_L}k&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in A:g_L(\\varphi)\\le k\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}_L(A)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\mathrm{PrfRel}_{L,A}(p,g_L(\\bot_L)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条保留原有的外部证明关系与图公式一致性句，同时补出一般语言的公式公理证明构造。逻辑内核显式分成逻辑公理、MP 和全称化；全称化的变量下标从本册量词树代码的第二个分量读取。非逻辑公理必须是句子，逻辑行和最终结论允许为开放公式。</p>\n<p>统一参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_L\">\\(\\pi_L\\)</span> 不要求能从一个外延集合有效选择程序；它是满足明确谓词的已固定参数。有限片段的公理公式采用按代码排序的有限析取，不由未声明的有限枚举习惯决定。PA 内桥接写入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GPrfSystem}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{GPrfSystem}_L\\)</span>，而不是从逐数正确性推得。后续一般语言条目必须固定同一系统。</p>\n<p>输入档案的原书来源位置予以保留。本轮没有原书 PDF，未重新核验原书证明，也没有生成机器证明；本条给出的桥接条件是显式的表示接口前提，而非已完成其全部构造正确性证明的声明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-pr-definitional-extension","statu